// Deprecated name kept as a pointer for readers.
//
// The actual Renode startup script now loads Renode's installed STM32F103 model:
//
//     machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/stm32f103.repl
//
// BMS-specific virtual peripherals live in:
//
//     platforms/bms_stm32f103_bq76940_addons.repl
//
// Renode platform files are similar to device trees, but they describe the
// virtual hardware Renode should instantiate, not the firmware's driver binding
// data.
